# NOTE: /vendor is INTENTIONALLY tracked in git (owner request): the host has
# no terminal/composer, so the repo itself must ship the production vendor.
# Keep it production-only: `composer install --no-dev` before committing
# vendor changes, and keep vendor/instashop/installer as a REAL COPY
# (not a symlink) so host checkouts work without composer.
